WEBVTT

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:35.440
All right.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:48.780
Come with me.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.550
No one's been in that room since.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.180
The day my brother died.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.800
We can't stop Percentimus now.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:05.940
We'll have to search the room.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:06.910
Wait.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:08.900
Okay, let's go.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:19.800
Levy's on the balcony.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.080
I like that dirt!

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:40.700
Good night, Mr. Roday.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.870
Harpoon, post your men around the house and watch for Wayne.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.400
I thought surely they would find you.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.320
Duval is suspicious.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:02:59.976
Thank you.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.360
posted his men around the house.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:04.330
I can get past the guards.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.300
I'll go to City Bill Abbey's

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.080
and present your evidence against Duval.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.480
No, Elaine, you can't...

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.680
Oh, I can get there already.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:24.290
But, Elaine, I...

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:25.270
Don't worry about me.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.380
I'll get to City Bill Abbey's all right,

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.940
but you must remain in hiding till I...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.460
I'll get back.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.420
Wayne and Miss Cordy are in the house.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:39.820
Capture them!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:54.500
I'll up your men, El Chaitan, or I'll...

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.020
I made your boots!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.400
So are you, El Shaitan!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:05.880
No, I'm not.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.610
If I were ill, Shaitan...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.360
I'd have my men shoot you down now.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.320
then why are you masquerading as El Shaitan?

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.570
It was the only way I could outwit Colonel Duval.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.660
and take you back to Paris to stand trial for gunrunning.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.640
Tom isn't a gunrunner.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.150
His innocence has been proved!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.970
That's not for me to decide.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:24.660
The American Embassy wants him.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.930
And I'm going to see that they get him.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.750
You can't take me now. Duval is the head of the gunrunners.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.780
And I have proof that he is El Chaitan.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.080
Yes, and I'm going to present Tom's evidence to the commanding general at City of the Labus.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.260
Not until I get Wayne safely across the border.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.070
I can't take any chances of losing my prisoner now.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.210
See that Miss Coyle doesn't leave this house until morning.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:48.790
Bye, Tom.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:50.150
Goodbye, Elaine.

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:55.730
Come on.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.500
Didn't I tell you Miss Corday was not to be harmed?

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:14.010
HEY!

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.360
We've no time to lose now!

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:24.720
Who goes there?

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:25.450
I don't know

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.760
Advance Colonel Duval, be recognized.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.280
Schmidt's still in Duval's office.

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.580
He must have found something important.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.000
He's been in there a long time.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:42.900
Get him out.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:43.740
Duval's coming.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.450
Thought I'd eat first, then take a look.

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:09.390
It's too late to find anything now.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.300
Colonel Duvall is coming, hurry!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:46.820
Go there!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:48.560
I am Al Cadour.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:50.670
see Colonel Duval at once.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.190
I'll tell the Colonel you're here.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.770
El Cador, see you, sir.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:08.740
Join me in.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:24.840
Has anything gone wrong?

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.770
On the contrary, our plans work perfectly.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:29.980
guns and ammunition or

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.100
safe at the devil's crater.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.590
Come on now, sneak it around and fire down, sir.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:49.640
Don't let him get away.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:03.580
Thanks.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:04.570
We were right.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.620
Duval is El Shaitan, and El Khadur is his lieutenant.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.980
Yeah, and they got the guns hidden at the Devil's Crater.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:20.630
We were attacked.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.880
I must report to the Colonel.

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:24.400
Thank you.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.010
Right there.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:36.960
All upon the beetroot, sir.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.520
Wounded and reporting an attack.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:39.280
Thank you very much.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:43.320
Who attacked you?

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.920
Major Booth and some Arabs, sir.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.950
They've captured Lieutenant Wayne and are taking him across the border.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:54.020
They're sure to head for Fezroy. That's the nearest point across the border.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.090
I'll send a picked troop to cut them off.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:08.440
No.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.740
We mustn't slow down until we reach Pesaroid.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.350
Thank you.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.390
I can't get very far without a horse!

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:58.290
Period.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:32.600
Fire down and pick him up!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.040
It's too steep for our horses, we'll have to go around.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.670
That's who you are, Wayne. I've got you.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:01.670
Sounds like coal over there!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.060
We better investigate!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:14.420
WAIT!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:15.530
They've gotten cracked!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:17.980
Fellas, take care of the app!

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:18.900
I'm going out the booth!

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:13.200
Let's go!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:16.080
Say what the...

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:17.460
Okay.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.660
Where did you fellas get here?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.780
We found out where Booth was taking you.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:33.780
Yeah, and we found out plenty more.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:38.120
Duval and El Cador have hidden the guns and the ammunition at the Devil's Crater.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:43.960
If we can capture those guns, we'll have plenty of evidence against Duval by the time Elaine gets back with General Foray.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:07.560
Place of God.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.750
Well, we got in the back way once before, didn't we?

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.530
Attaboy! Let's go!

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.000
Wait!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:56.670
Those shots came from the Devil's Crater!

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:57.410
Forward!

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:09.720
What are we going to do with it?

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.830
We'll have to get some trucks from the barracks.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.820
Meanwhile, we'll seal up the miles of caves so nobody can get in.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.530
Wayne and the three deserters.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.300
Surrender, or we fire!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.700
Duck back and put out the fuse. We'll get away through the cave.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:52.180
Fire!
